{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sightline is an action-adventure built around one idea: vision is both a tool \u2014 and a curse. With your LiDAR goggles, you see the world as shifting dots, an approximation that keeps you moving while hiding the finer details. Brief glimpses of true sight remind you of what\u2019s hidden. <br><br>You begin on a hostile planet: avoiding enemies, collecting weapon parts, and pushing through ambushes. Survive the first descent to open the way to Orven. <br><br>On Orven, the stakes rise. Face a new enemy, recover a stolen relic, and bring down the Echo Warden. Combat blends melee with lethal long-range threats, demanding sharp reflexes and the ability to read the battlefield through your distorted vision.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808440?t=1758765826","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808440?t=1758765826","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808440/04a05777bc8c328b726beaff8ff8db4419b40743/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758765826","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808440/04a05777bc8c328b726beaff8ff8db4419b40743/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758765826","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sightline is an action-adventure built around one idea: vision is both a tool \u2014 and a curse. With your LiDAR goggles, you see the world as shifting dots, an approximation that keeps you moving while hiding the finer details. Brief glimpses of true sight remind you of what\u2019s hidden. <br><br>You begin on a hostile planet: avoiding enemies, collecting weapon parts, and pushing through ambushes. Survive the first descent to open the way to Orven. <br><br>On Orven, the stakes rise. Face 